{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11204120","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11204120","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:3:1120412001:0":{"text":"안녕하세요! 혹시 잭슨과 그의 어머니에 대해 들어보셨나요? 아마 세일린워터 마을에 살았을 거예요.","source_cn":"热情的蛮血镇民！请问你听说过贾克松和他的母亲吗？他们应...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA82FB865585B10D7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1120412002:1":{"text":"네, 들어봤어요! 덩치는 큰데 돈이 없어서, 종종 안 좋은 일을 한다고 들었죠.","source_cn":"哦，我知道他！很威武雄壮，但没什么钱，听说他为了钱，做...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3A6AA27B919D1961","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1120412003:1":{"text":"마지막으로 들은 소식은 거금을 들여서 탐험 장비를 사들여, 크림슨 고원으로 보물찾기를 떠난다고 했어요.","source_cn":"我最后一次听说他的消息，是他花钱买了一批探险用具，热火...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6B7A905834D6F159","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1120412004:1":{"text":"어머니라… 잭슨의 나이를 생각하면 그의 어머니도 나이가 지긋하실 텐데… 본 적이 없네요.","source_cn":"至于母亲……贾克松那个年龄，他的母亲应该年纪也很大了吧...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0C6A82B4BD202CA6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1120412005:0":{"text":"그럼 혹시 상록수 학회의 엘리노어에 대해 들어보셨나요?","source_cn":"那么，请问你听说过冬青学会的埃莉诺吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x612A26B181E9C07B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1120412006:1":{"text":"전혀요. 다른 주민에게 물어보세요.","source_cn":"没有耶，要不你们再问问其他人？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x05777A081773E01D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:伽利":{"text":"갈리","source":"伽利","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:咸水镇民绒掌":{"text":"롱잔","source":"咸水镇民绒掌","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:梅丽莎":{"text":"멜리사","source":"梅丽莎","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":7,"localized_text_count":6,"speaker_count":3}}